OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWarning to women amid shortages of
OL,4,Asome HRT products
OL,5,
OL,6,FWomen have been warned against
OL,7,Fself-medicating to manage menopause
OL,8,Fsymptoms amid a shortage of some
OL,9,FHormone Replacement Therapy (HRT)
OL,10,Fmedications.
OL,12,FPharmacist Paul Irvine said he
OL,13,Funderstood that women were "concerned"
OL,14,Fbut urged them to speak to their GP or
OL,15,Flocal chemist who could advise them
OL,16,Fabout alternatives.
OL,18,FThe warning follows official
OL,19,Fconfirmation from the Department of
OL,20,FHealth (DoH) that supplies of two major
OL,21,FHRT patch brands have been disrupted.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
