OL,3,GNEWSAWarning to women amid shortages of
OL,4,Asome HRT products
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe affected products include Estradot
OL,7,Ftransdermal and FemSeven Conti, both of
OL,8,Fwhich are currently facing
OL,9,Fmanufacturing or distribution delays.
